FourIsland_Text_IslandSign::
    .string "FOUR ISLAND\n"
    .string "Where the cold remembers$"

FourIsland_Text_LoreleiHasReturned::
    .string "LORELEI has returned.\p"
    .string "Did she find the city life too\n"
    .string "stressful, I wonder?$"

FourIsland_Text_LoreleiMetLaprasAsChild::
    .string "LORELEI has gone back.\p"
    .string "The LAPRAS she has, I imagine it\n"
    .string "to be the one she met as a child.\p"
    .string "I believe it was in ICEFALL CAVE\n"
    .string "that she caught it.\p"
    .string "Perhaps that POKéMON has been with\n"
    .string "her ever since.$"

FourIsland_Text_RivalAlreadyGotEggBeSmellingYa::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hey!\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}!\p"
    .string "What are you doing here in the\n"
    .string "SEVII ISLANDS?\p"
    .string "You should quit copying me,\n"
    .string "you know?\p"
    .string "Anyways, I already got my POKéMON\n"
    .string "EGG, so I'm done with this island.\p"
    .string "Heh, I bet you don't even know\n"
    .string "about POKéMON EGGS.\p"
    .string "You'll never fill your NATIONAL\n"
    .string "POKéDEX that way.\p"
    .string "By the way, I saw someone we both\n"
    .string "know on this island.\p"
    .string "Why don't you go look around if\n"
    .string "it makes you curious?\p"
    .string "Me, I don't have the time to\n"
    .string "waste.\p"
    .string "Be smelling ya!$"

FourIsland_Text_LoreleiHasLotsOfStuffedDolls::
    .string "Oh, you found me!\n"
    .string "Please don't tell LORELEI.\p"
    .string "Did you know that LORELEI has lots\n"
    .string "and lots of stuffed dolls?\p"
    .string "Every time she comes back to\n"
    .string "FOUR ISLAND, her collection grows!$"

FourIsland_Text_MadeSlushieUsingIcefallCaveIce::
    .string "Ooh, chilly!\p"
    .string "I made a slushie using ice I\n"
    .string "shaved inside ICEFALL CAVE.\p"
    .string "It's chilly and tasty!$"

FourIsland_Text_LoreleisHouse::
    .string "LORELEI'S HOUSE$"


FourIsland_Text_Lord1::
    .string "GLACIA: Frozen cities, frozen\n"
    .string "kings... it happened before. I will\l"
    .string "see how your crown holds against\n"
    .string "ice!$"

FourIsland_Text_Lord2::
    .string "Warm. You are warm.$"

FourIsland_Text_Lord3::
    .string "GLACIA: A ruler who can still feel\n"
    .string "the cold is a good ruler. Take this.$"

FourIsland_Text_LordEarly::
    .string "GLACIA: Not yet. The old LEAGUE\n"
    .string "and the MASTERS must fall first.\n"
    .string "FLORA will tell you the way.$"

FourIsland_Text_LordDone::
    .string "GLACIA: A ruler worthy of the six.\n"
    .string "I will remember this day.$"

FourIsland_Text_LordIdle::
    .string "GLACIA: The islands are quiet. I look\n"
    .string "after them, as I always have.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefAsk::
    .string "MAYA: A strange fish lives in a cold\n"
    .string "pond. It is ill and nobody can\n"
    .string "see it. Three ICE HEALS, please.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefOffer::
    .string "MAYA: You have them! May I take\n"
    .string "3 of them for the post?$"

FourIsland_Text_RefNo::
    .string "MAYA: I understand. It is a lot to\n"
    .string "ask. The offer stands.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefGives::
    .string "MAYA: You saved the day. The post\n"
    .string "has a gift for you: FEEBAS!$"

FourIsland_Text_RefAfter::
    .string "MAYA: Take good care of it. The\n"
    .string "next REFUGE post is waiting.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefEarly::
    .string "MAYA: Not yet. Finish the earlier\n"
    .string "posts first. The KEEPER at the\n"
    .string "SAFARI ZONE knows the order.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefDone::
    .string "MAYA: Thank you again. The REFUGE\n"
    .string "is safer because of you.$"

FourIsland_Text_RefIdle::
    .string "MAYA: I watch over the animals here.\n"
    .string "The world is quieter now.$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_Intro::
	.string "{PLAYER}! You beat the LEAGUE? Then\n"
	.string "you can handle my dragons. Do not\p"
	.string "hold back!$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_Defeat::
	.string "Magnificent! The dragons approve!$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_Win::
	.string "A fang from my oldest dragon. Take\n"
	.string "it.$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_After::
	.string "Dragons respect strength. You have\n"
	.string "it.$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_Early::
	.string "Come back after the LEAGUE. Dragons\n"
	.string "wait for no one.$"

FourIsland_Text_ProcheDylan_NoRoom::
	.string "Your BAG is full. Make some room\n"
	.string "first, then talk to me again.$"
